- !<Text/fffd13fb-d15b-4a29-b67b-9a378b4d3e2f>
  PrefabRemaps:
    []
  Name: Text
  Enabled: true
  RenderOrder: 11
  StretchMode: Stretch
  VerticalAlignment: Center
  HorizontalAlignment: Left
  MeshShadowMode: None
  ShadowColor: {x: 1.000000, y: 1.000000, z: 1.000000, w: 1.000000}
  ShadowDensity: 1.000000
  Text: |-
    Video Call S2M connects you on Specs with a friend on an iPhone: your POV video and voice go to their phone, and their camera comes back onto a panel in front of you.
    Pick the modes and the GPS source on the start menu, then press Start.
    Live calls need the iPhone companion app, your own Snap Cloud project and a Specs device.
